{"questionId":"u13-s009-v001","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-roots-count","lockedSkillOrder":9,"difficulty":"basic","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"x²-9=0 有幾個相異實根？","givenConditions":"a=1。","target":"判斷實根個數","choices":["0 個","2 個","1 個","3 個"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"分解 (x-3)(x+3)=0；得到兩個不同根，所以答案為「2 個」。 平方差分解後兩個一次因式分別產生正三與負三，兩值不同且都為實數，所以相異實根共有兩個。二次方程式最多兩根，不會因正負號再多算。","steps":["分解 (x-3)(x+3)=0","得到兩個不同根","列出正三與負三並比較兩值，確認確為兩個相異根。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"0 個","truth":false,"reason":"忽略平方差可解。"},{"choice":"2 個","truth":true,"reason":"根為 3、-3，數值不同。"},{"choice":"1 個","truth":false,"reason":"把 ±3 視為同一根。"},{"choice":"3 個","truth":false,"reason":"二次方程式不可能有三個相異根。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"混淆正負根或二次上限 正三與負三是兩個相異實根，不能把正負成對誤算為一根或更多根。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-complete-square-basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":45,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"問相異實根。","difficultyReason":"基本兩根型。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"判斷實根個數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"230e783bec8a818fcacb31a71b2eea446364d87434cb09fc5427afbf8fa9e189"}
{"questionId":"u13-s009-v002","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-roots-count","lockedSkillOrder":9,"difficulty":"basic","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"(x-4)²=0 有幾個相異實根？","givenConditions":"相異根計數。","target":"判斷重根個數","choices":["0 個","2 個","4 個","1 個"],"answerIndex":3,"explanation":"令 x-4=0；得唯一根 4，所以答案為「1 個」。 平方因式等於零時，底數只能為零，故未知數只有四這一個值。雖然同一因式重複兩次，題目問相異實根個數，重複根只能計一次。","steps":["令 x-4=0","得唯一根 4","辨認重根後只列一次 x=4，並代回平方式確認。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"0 個","truth":false,"reason":"平方可以等於 0。"},{"choice":"2 個","truth":false,"reason":"±0 是同一數。"},{"choice":"4 個","truth":false,"reason":"把常數 4 當根數。"},{"choice":"1 個","truth":true,"reason":"只有 x=4。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"把重複因式算兩根 重複因式代表同一根重複出現，不是兩個相異根。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-complete-square-basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":45,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"+0=-0。","difficultyReason":"基本重根型。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"判斷重根個數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"12ddee33241bba313549c956ee7153ce57df9cd3b247e7bb1e0438261c362639"}
{"questionId":"u13-s009-v003","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-roots-count","lockedSkillOrder":9,"difficulty":"basic","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"x²+4=0 在實數範圍有幾個根？","givenConditions":"限定實數。","target":"判斷無實根","choices":["1 個","2 個","0 個","4 個"],"answerIndex":2,"explanation":"移項得 x²=-4；實數平方非負，因此無根，所以答案為「0 個」。 移項要求實數平方等於負四，但任何實數平方都大於或等於零，不可能滿足。題目限定實數範圍，因此不能引入複數單位，實根個數為零。","steps":["移項得 x²=-4","實數平方非負，因此無根","以實數平方非負性排除所有實數，明確回答相異實根為零。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"1 個","truth":false,"reason":"沒有實數可平方成 -4。"},{"choice":"2 個","truth":false,"reason":"誤寫 ±2。"},{"choice":"0 個","truth":true,"reason":"等價於 x²=-4，不可能。"},{"choice":"4 個","truth":false,"reason":"把常數當根數。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"忽略實數範圍與負號 負數沒有實平方根；無理根仍是實數，不能與複數根混淆。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-complete-square-basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":45,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"不使用複數。","difficultyReason":"基本無根型。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"判斷無實根","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"43970da8c1678c949e2e95d0044cbf8832274f562af85d83ded392bd273f7a86"}
{"questionId":"u13-s009-v004","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-roots-count","lockedSkillOrder":9,"difficulty":"standard","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"2x²+4x+2=0 有幾個相異實根？","givenConditions":"a=2≠0。","target":"使用結構判根數","choices":["1 個","0 個","2 個","無法判斷"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"提 2：2(x+1)²=0；得到 x=-1 一個根，所以答案為「1 個」。 全式提出非零常數二後，括號內是未知數加一的完全平方；乘積等於零只可能使平方底數為零，得到負一。相同根重複兩次仍只有一個相異值。","steps":["提 2：2(x+1)²=0","得到 x=-1 一個根","令 x+1=0 得負一，代回原式並只計一次相異根。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"1 個","truth":true,"reason":"可除以 2 得 (x+1)²=0，或 Δ=0。"},{"choice":"0 個","truth":false,"reason":"完全平方可為 0。"},{"choice":"2 個","truth":false,"reason":"重根只算一個相異值。"},{"choice":"無法判斷","truth":false,"reason":"係數已足夠。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"未辨認完全平方 先辨認完全平方與重根，相同的一次因式不可重複計成兩個相異解。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-complete-square-basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":65,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"相異根。","difficultyReason":"非首項 1 的重根。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"使用結構判根數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"1febf0377cfd557c1bcc6bf6a3408f083913816ea8aa705055839258e0c1b0e2"}
{"questionId":"u13-s009-v005","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-roots-count","lockedSkillOrder":9,"difficulty":"standard","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"x²-2x-8=0 有幾個相異實根？","givenConditions":"a=1。","target":"判斷根數","choices":["0 個","1 個","8 個","2 個"],"answerIndex":3,"explanation":"計算 Δ=(-2)²-4·1·(-8)=36；正判別式代表兩根，所以答案為「2 個」。 判別式計算時常數為負八，所以減四倍係數乘負八會變成加三十二；加上一次項係數平方四得到三十六。正判別式表示有兩個不同實根。","steps":["計算 Δ=(-2)²-4·1·(-8)=36","正判別式代表兩根","依判別式正、零、負的對應規則判為兩個相異實根。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"0 個","truth":false,"reason":"Δ 不是負。"},{"choice":"1 個","truth":false,"reason":"Δ 不等於 0。"},{"choice":"8 個","truth":false,"reason":"把常數絕對值當根數。"},{"choice":"2 個","truth":true,"reason":"Δ=4+32=36>0。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"判別式符號錯 判別式末項含雙重負號，算錯符號會誤判根的個數。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-complete-square-basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":60,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"兩根相異。","difficultyReason":"正判別式。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"判斷根數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"3705b65a385a5d26359b913bfa83af67471fb87eb293b4bc80fefcbb7c9daa7e"}
{"questionId":"u13-s009-v006","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-roots-count","lockedSkillOrder":9,"difficulty":"standard","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"3x²+x+2=0 有幾個實根？","givenConditions":"a=3≠0。","target":"判斷負判別式根數","choices":["1 個","0 個","2 個","3 個"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"計算 Δ=-23；判定無實根，所以答案為「0 個」。 判別式為一次項係數平方一減四乘三乘二，得到負二十三；判別式小於零表示開根部分不是實數，因此方程式沒有實根。二次項正負本身不能決定根數。","steps":["計算 Δ=-23","判定無實根","將負二十三與零比較，依實數範圍判定相異實根為零。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"1 個","truth":false,"reason":"Δ 不為 0。"},{"choice":"0 個","truth":true,"reason":"Δ=1-24=-23<0。"},{"choice":"2 個","truth":false,"reason":"Δ 為負。"},{"choice":"3 個","truth":false,"reason":"二次不可能三根。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"只看二次項正就亂猜 根數要由判別式或等價平方形式判斷，不能只看二次項係數正負。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-complete-square-basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":65,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"實數範圍。","difficultyReason":"非完全平方負判別式。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"判斷負判別式根數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"f93e20e1fc12f4246db796c559a0e3f4bca07fbbbc879343626103541731ac98"}
{"questionId":"u13-s009-v007","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-roots-count","lockedSkillOrder":9,"difficulty":"advanced","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"若 k 為正整數，且 x²+kx+1=0 有兩個相異實根，k 的最小值為何？","givenConditions":"k 為正整數，a=1。","target":"求參數的最小正整數值","choices":["3","2","1","4"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"由 k²-4>0 且 k>0 得 k>2；正整數中最小為 3，所以答案為「3」。 兩相異實根要求判別式嚴格大於零，正參數因此大於二；邊界二會使判別式等於零而只有重根。再套正整數條件，第一個符合值是三。","steps":["由 k²-4>0 且 k>0 得 k>2","正整數中最小為 3","檢查 k=2 為重根邊界、k=3 判別式為正，確認最小值。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"3","truth":true,"reason":"Δ=k²-4>0，正整數 k 必須大於 2，最小為 3。"},{"choice":"2","truth":false,"reason":"此時 Δ=0，只有重根。"},{"choice":"1","truth":false,"reason":"此時 Δ=-3，沒有實根。"},{"choice":"4","truth":false,"reason":"雖符合，但不是最小正整數。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"只解不等式卻未套正整數與最小值","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-complete-square-basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":115,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"相異排除 k=2，最小值要求檢查邊界下一個整數。","difficultyReason":"結合根個數、離散條件與極小值。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"求參數的最小正整數值","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"95674a713829cee7177fe1bb4c186fc13ec1d2d2c09479af87623727849cb4e2"}
{"questionId":"u13-s009-v008","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-roots-count","lockedSkillOrder":9,"difficulty":"advanced","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"x²+(m-1)x+(m-1)=0 有一個相異實根時，m 為何？","givenConditions":"a=1。","target":"求所有重根參數","choices":["只有 m=1","只有 m=5","m=1 或 m=5","1<m<5"],"answerIndex":2,"explanation":"Δ=(m-1)²-4(m-1)；因式分解為 (m-1)(m-5)=0，所以答案為「m=1 或 m=5」。 有一個相異實根表示判別式等於零。提出公因式後的兩個參數因子都可能為零，分別給一與五；代回時兩式皆成完全平方，確實各有一個重根。","steps":["Δ=(m-1)²-4(m-1)","因式分解為 (m-1)(m-5)=0","分別代入 m=1、m=5 計算判別式，確認兩者皆為零。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"只有 m=1","truth":false,"reason":"漏掉第二個零點。"},{"choice":"只有 m=5","truth":false,"reason":"漏掉第一個零點。"},{"choice":"m=1 或 m=5","truth":true,"reason":"Δ=(m-1)(m-5)，令 0。"},{"choice":"1<m<5","truth":false,"reason":"此區間 Δ<0。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"解參數乘積方程漏一分支 參數乘積等於零要保留兩個分支，不能只令其中一個因式為零。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-complete-square-basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":115,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"兩個參數值皆有效。","difficultyReason":"參數判別式可分解。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"求所有重根參數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"f13576ee38a5ce083487291d474cdf1c4cc6327e1a24ae1fcbd6bb81ac1a80f2"}
{"questionId":"u13-s009-v009","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-roots-count","lockedSkillOrder":9,"difficulty":"advanced","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"對任意實數 a，方程式 (x-a)²=9 有幾個相異實根？","givenConditions":"a 任意實數。","target":"判斷含平移參數的固定根數","choices":["0 個","1 個","視 a 而定","2 個"],"answerIndex":3,"explanation":"開平方 x-a=±3；根 a+3、a-3，所以答案為「2 個」。 平方等於正九，開平方固定得到正三與負三，因此兩根是參數加三與參數減三。兩根之差恆為六，不會因任何實數參數而重合。","steps":["開平方 x-a=±3","根 a+3、a-3","比較 a+3 與 a−3 的差為六，確認始終是兩個相異實根。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"0 個","truth":false,"reason":"右邊 9>0。"},{"choice":"1 個","truth":false,"reason":"±3 不會重合。"},{"choice":"視 a 而定","truth":false,"reason":"a 只平移兩根，不改根距離。"},{"choice":"2 個","truth":true,"reason":"x=a±3，兩值相差 6，永遠不同。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"以為參數會改變根數 參數只平移兩個根，不改變它們固定相差六的事實與根數。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-complete-square-basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":95,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"兩根永不重合。","difficultyReason":"結構推理不需判別式。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"判斷含平移參數的固定根數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"9105356fb53ca202559ac0924a0343a9bdc74171a542e574f12099ec38a55817"}
{"questionId":"u13-s009-v010","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-roots-count","lockedSkillOrder":9,"difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"拱門高度設計方程式為 h²-10h+25=0。可行高度值有幾個？","givenConditions":"高度需實數；唯一根 5 也為正。","target":"判斷可行高度數","choices":["1 個","0 個","2 個","25 個"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"辨認完全平方；得到唯一高度 h=5，所以答案為「1 個」。 三項式正好是高度減五的平方，只有高度等於五時平方為零。兩個相同因式代表重根；即使代數重數為二，可行的相異高度值仍只有一個。","steps":["辨認完全平方","得到唯一高度 h=5","解 h−5=0 並以 h=5 代回高度式確認唯一相異值。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"1 個","truth":true,"reason":"方程式為 (h-5)²=0，只有 h=5。"},{"choice":"0 個","truth":false,"reason":"平方可為 0。"},{"choice":"2 個","truth":false,"reason":"重根不算兩個相異高度。"},{"choice":"25 個","truth":false,"reason":"常數項與根數無關。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"把重根當兩方案 重根在情境中仍是一個可行高度值，不能當成兩種不同方案。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-complete-square-basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":80,"unitCheck":"高度沿用題目設計單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"沒有額外篩選造成變化。","difficultyReason":"以根數解釋設計方案數。","literacyContextNecessity":"此情境資訊不可刪除且會改變答案，因為「可行高度值」將相異實根個數轉為方案數。","authoringIntent":"判斷可行高度數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"2df1d9af750735ee0cac44c964aa3af6553644d52bbef31dd64a76a8717c8708"}
{"questionId":"u13-s009-v011","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-roots-count","lockedSkillOrder":9,"difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"感測器校正式 x²-6x+13=0。若只接受實數校正值，系統有幾個可接受值？","givenConditions":"只接受實數。","target":"判斷校正值數量","choices":["1 個","2 個","0 個","13 個"],"answerIndex":2,"explanation":"計算 Δ=-16；無實數根，所以無可接受值，所以答案為「0 個」。 判別式三十六減五十二得到負十六，表示方程式在實數範圍沒有解，所以系統沒有可接受校正值。負判別式不是無理實根，而是開根部分超出實數。","steps":["計算 Δ=-16","無實數根，所以無可接受值","依系統只接受實數的條件，將代數判定轉成零個可接受值。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"1 個","truth":false,"reason":"Δ 不為 0。"},{"choice":"2 個","truth":false,"reason":"Δ 為負。"},{"choice":"0 個","truth":true,"reason":"Δ=36-52=-16<0。"},{"choice":"13 個","truth":false,"reason":"常數項不是值的個數。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"把負判別式誤作無理根 判別式小於零代表無實根；無理根只會在判別式為正但非完全平方時出現。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-complete-square-basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":85,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"無根時不再套其他限制。","difficultyReason":"系統可行性判斷。","literacyContextNecessity":"此情境資訊不可刪除且會改變答案，因為「只接受實數」直接連結判別式與可接受值數量。","authoringIntent":"判斷校正值數量","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"d9237c5831f353f5a80d90614ea7840b645764f4f6cad907673679ee554b0047"}
{"questionId":"u13-s009-v012","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-roots-count","lockedSkillOrder":9,"difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"票價模型的損益方程式為 n²-2pn+(p²-4)=0。若 p 為實數，這個方程式有兩個不同實數解的 p 條件為何？","givenConditions":"p 為實數；題目只要求兩解為不同實數，未要求解為正數。","target":"判斷有兩個不同實數解的參數條件","choices":["p>2","所有實數 p","p=2","p≥0"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"二次項係數為一，判別式 Δ=(-2p)²-4(p²-4)=4p²-4p²+16=16。因為十六對每個實數 p 都大於零，方程式始終有兩個不同實數解，所以 p 可為任意實數。亦可將方程式改寫為 (n-p)²=4，兩解 p+2 與 p-2 恒相差四，再次驗證結論。","steps":["以 a=1、b=-2p、c=p²-4 寫出判別式。","化簡得 Δ=16，對所有實數 p 皆大於零。","判定每個實數 p 都有兩個不同實數解，並以 p±2 驗算。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"p>2","truth":false,"reason":"p≤2 時判別式仍為16，也有兩個不同實數解。"},{"choice":"所有實數 p","truth":true,"reason":"判別式恒為16>0，不需對 p 再加限制。"},{"choice":"p=2","truth":false,"reason":"p=2 只是可行值之一，不是唯一可行值。"},{"choice":"p≥0","truth":false,"reason":"負數 p 的判別式同樣為16，仍符合條件。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"把參數出現在係數中誤當成必須限制大小，沒有先完整化簡判別式。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-complete-square-basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":100,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"判別式恒為16，沒有等於零的邊界值；題幹已明示 p 為實數。","difficultyReason":"需正確將含參數的三個係數代入判別式，並辨認參數項完全消去。","literacyContextNecessity":"情境中「兩個不同實數解」明確對應判別式大於零，且排除自行加上正值限制的誤讀。","authoringIntent":"判斷判別式恒正時的兩實根條件","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"872c743b3aad76010ae533693d8a4b9dddc9b34af7fc95b36e234bb0fc273dcc"}
